{"kp_id": "zj-021.kp0001", "video_id": "zj-021", "type": "acupoint_usage", "statement": "丰隆等足阳明穴可用于丰胸；脚部穴道系统学完亦可用于针灸美容。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.st40", "meridian.st"], "chapter_id": "zj-021.c01", "evidence_quote": "丰隆穴也可以丰胸", "seg_from": 1, "seg_to": 2, "start_s": 2.77, "end_s": 13.41, "citation": {"youtube_id": "HG6dvbRlGXc", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HG6dvbRlGXc&t=2s", "series": "zj", "episode": 21, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 21", "start_s": 2.77, "end_s": 13.41}, "confidence": 0.85, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-021.kp0002", "video_id": "zj-021", "type": "concept_definition", "statement": "中医认为奶水与月经相关，此系统由心所主；阳明与冲脉下行胞宫，月经来潮则胸胀渐消。", "entity_ids": ["zangfu.xin", "meridian.st", "meridian.tv"], "chapter_id": "zj-021.c01", "evidence_quote": "奶水就是月经，而这个系统呢是心脏在管", "seg_from": 38, "seg_to": 44, "start_s": 197.21, "end_s": 247.74, "citation": {"youtube_id": "HG6dvbRlGXc", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HG6dvbRlGXc&t=197s", "series": "zj", "episode": 21, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 21", "start_s": 197.21, "end_s": 247.74}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "味精=胃经；冲卖=冲脉", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-021.kp0003", "video_id": "zj-021", "type": "treatment_principle", "statement": "乳腺硬块初期可按所过经络取穴消散，局部硬结处加灸，早期效佳。", "entity_ids": ["method.zhen_jiu"], "chapter_id": "zj-021.c01", "evidence_quote": "有硬块的地方灸，这是最初期的百分之百为好", "seg_from": 111, "seg_to": 189, "start_s": 635.66, "end_s": 1056.845, "citation": {"youtube_id": "HG6dvbRlGXc", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HG6dvbRlGXc&t=635s", "series": "zj", "episode": 21, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 21", "start_s": 635.66, "end_s": 1056.85}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-021.kp0004", "video_id": "zj-021", "type": "contraindication", "statement": "乳中一般不下针；旁开穴可针。乳根在乳房下缘，常用于美容及局部治疗。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.st17", "acupoint.st18"], "chapter_id": "zj-021.c01", "evidence_quote": "乳中呢就是不要下乳中旁边都可以下", "seg_from": 209, "seg_to": 216, "start_s": 1148.93, "end_s": 1190.12, "citation": {"youtube_id": "HG6dvbRlGXc", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HG6dvbRlGXc&t=1148s", "series": "zj", "episode": 21, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 21", "start_s": 1148.93, "end_s": 1190.12}, "confidence": 0.95, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-021.kp0005", "video_id": "zj-021", "type": "acupoint_usage", "statement": "不容在巨阙外开两寸；名示“食入不容”，治胃胀食不下。巨阙为心募。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.st19", "acupoint.cv14", "concept.mu_xue"], "chapter_id": "zj-021.c02", "evidence_quote": "从巨缺外开两寸就是不容", "seg_from": 247, "seg_to": 249, "start_s": 1373.75, "end_s": 1390.425, "citation": {"youtube_id": "HG6dvbRlGXc", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HG6dvbRlGXc&t=1373s", "series": "zj", "episode": 21, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 21", "start_s": 1373.75, "end_s": 1390.42}, "confidence": 0.95, "asr_note": "巨缺=巨阙；墓穴=募穴", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-021.kp0006", "video_id": "zj-021", "type": "acupoint_usage", "statement": "神阙久灸可治肠鸣腹泻，常配合天枢；针、灸皆可。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.cv8", "acupoint.st25"], "chapter_id": "zj-021.c02", "evidence_quote": "肠明腹泻，还有我们可以配合天枢穴", "seg_from": 286, "seg_to": 288, "start_s": 1556.24, "end_s": 1577.48, "citation": {"youtube_id": "HG6dvbRlGXc", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HG6dvbRlGXc&t=1556s", "series": "zj", "episode": 21, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 21", "start_s": 1556.24, "end_s": 1577.48}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "神缺=神阙；肠明=肠鸣", "source": "llm_read"}
